{"id":"559773990f","t":"National-Level Dungeon architect","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/2026-03-28-12-09-54-1774656594429-193x278.jpg","n":44,"l":45,"s":["ml","mg"],"k":{"ml":"national-level-dungeon-architect","mg":"national-level-dungeon-architect"},"u":1795078602260,"desc":"سيو يول هي رئيسة قسم الحماية والاستكشاف، المسؤولة عن عمليات البحث والإنقاذ في مواقع أحداث الأبراج المحصنة. في لحظة حاسمة، بين الحياة والموت، عندما يُحاصر قائد البرج المحصن أثناء محاولته القضاء على كائن خارق للطبيعة في مهمة تتقلص مساحتها، تُوقظ سيو يول الفئة الخفية: مصممو المتاهات. بعد أن اكتسبت القدرة على تصميم وتطوير متاهتها الخاصة، تبدأ سيو يول في تسخيرها لمواجهة الكائن الخارق للطبيعة…","type":"مانهوا","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اكشن","دراما","فانتازيا"],"src":{"ml":"national-level-dungeon-architect","mg":"national-level-dungeon-architect"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"national-level-dungeon-architect|/manga/national-level-dungeon-architect/1/","mg":"national-level-dungeon-architect|"},"2":{"ml":"national-level-dungeon-architect|/manga/national-level-dungeon-architect/2/","mg":"national-level-dungeon-architect|"},"3":{"ml":"national-level-dungeon-architect|/manga/national-level-dungeon-architect/3/","mg":"national-level-dungeon-architect|"},"4":{"ml":"national-level-dungeon-architect|/manga/national-level-dungeon-architect/4/","mg":"national-level-dungeon-architect|"},"5":{"ml":"national-level-dungeon-architect|/manga/national-level-dungeon-architect/5/","mg":"national-level-dungeon-architect|"},"6":{"ml":"national-level-dungeon-architect|/manga/national-level-dungeon-architect/6/","mg":"national-level-dungeon-architect|"},"7":{"ml":"national-level-dungeon-architect|/manga/national-level-dungeon-architect/7/","mg":"national-level-dungeon-architect|"},"8":{"ml":"national-level-dungeon-architect|/manga/national-level-dungeon-architect/8/","mg":"national-level-dungeon-architect|"},"10":{"ml":"national-level-dungeon-architect|/manga/national-level-dungeon-architect/10/","mg":"national-level